{"id":"n24864-1-10","stage":3,"title":"참여 · 参与","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24864-1-10-1","ko":"이번 투표에는 사람들의 참여가 정말 적었어.","zh":"这次投票的参与人数真的太少了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이번","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}},{"text":"투표에는","meaning":"投票","explanation":"투표：投票；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"투표","audio":"/audio/eb8dc84bf3cfa37142e1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"81630","senseId":"1","lemma":"투표","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"투표에는","audio":"/audio/4f7e5617c3a496f3513d.mp3"}},{"text":"사람들의","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람들의","audio":"/audio/b5de6ed0397d29c0e601.mp3"}},{"text":"참여가","meaning":"参与，出席，到场","explanation":"참여：参与，出席，到场；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"참여","audio":"/audio/4cd5815475446351a31c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24864","senseId":"1","lemma":"참여","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"참여가","audio":"/audio/d66bd06e8ef6b0b788c4.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"적었어.","meaning":"少，小，欠缺","explanation":"적다：少，小，欠缺；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"적다","audio":"/audio/5f930febe6cd0f79ee06.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62051","senseId":"1","lemma":"적다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"적었어","audio":"/audio/6d3e2ccec7ed0741e337.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"eb8dc84bf3cfa371","term":"투표","zh":"投票","audio":"/audio/eb8dc84bf3cfa37142e1.mp3","entryId":"81630","definition":"举行选举或决定某事时，在规定纸张上填写个人意见后投入票箱。","pronunciation":["투표"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人们，大家","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"对没有特别指定的，自己以外的人的称呼。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"4cd5815475446351","term":"참여","zh":"参与，出席，到场","audio":"/audio/4cd5815475446351a31c.mp3","entryId":"24864","definition":"介入多人一起做的某件事情，共同完成。","pronunciation":["차며"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"5f930febe6cd0f79","term":"적다","zh":"少，小，欠缺","audio":"/audio/5f930febe6cd0f79ee06.mp3","entryId":"62051","definition":"数、量或程度等达不到一定的标准。","pronunciation":["적ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/81f9c00ce4998f7b45f3.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n24864-1-10-2","ko":"홍보가 부족했던 게 아닐까?","zh":"是不是因为宣传做得不够好呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"홍보가","meaning":"宣传","explanation":"홍보：宣传；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"홍보","audio":"/audio/e1594a102757fad56ab7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87628","senseId":"1","lemma":"홍보","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"홍보가","audio":"/audio/e4fe21d8d9615297f4c5.mp3"}},{"text":"부족했던","meaning":"不足，缺乏，不够，欠缺","explanation":"부족하다：不足，缺乏，不够，欠缺；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；던：修饰后面的名词，回想过去持续、反复或尚未完成的情况。","readings":[{"term":"부족하다","audio":"/audio/3dd9c5f65c6da41a8a1c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59849","senseId":"1","lemma":"부족하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"부족했던","au